50	53	0	O aumento das ações judiciais contra planos de saúde no Brasil, que já representam 47% dos processos na área da saúde, é atribuído à frustração dos consumidores com negativas de cobertura e falhas no sistema regulatório. Especialistas sugerem que muitos conflitos poderiam ser evitados com melhores mecanismos administrativos. Apesar do crescimento das ações, as operadoras têm registrado lucros significativos. Ação judicial, ações judiciais, planos de saúde, negativas de cobertura, frustração do consumidor, crescimento de lucros, sistema regulatório, conflitos administrativos	[0.010925293,0.03314209,0.060302734,0.03778076,-0.0049057007,0.04171753,-0.021759033,-0.03466797,0.009986877,-0.018051147,0.025970459,-0.062927246,-0.045684814,-0.012802124,0.0043182373,-0.013534546,-0.006793976,-0.017944336,-0.006008148,-0.02330017,0.04815674,0.006526947,0.044891357,-0.02053833,-0.022140503,-0.03778076,-0.028137207,-0.022583008,-0.007926941,-0.0044136047,0.058288574,-0.0063972473,-0.005554199,0.0020275116,-0.023345947,0.04626465,-0.054656982,0.007347107,0.033203125,0.055847168,0.028625488,0.036468506,-0.03955078,0.041748047,-0.009429932,0.008201599,0.015594482,-0.045074463,-0.01977539,0.031585693,-0.022720337,0.021331787,-0.013183594,0.013839722,0.046447754,0.022338867,-0.013198853,0.031280518,-0.010917664,-0.009315491,0.01461792,-0.026977539,-0.038360596,-0.011413574,-0.034820557,0.036071777,0.016616821,0.015052795,-0.011543274,0.025054932,-0.0032806396,0.011550903,0.024353027,0.032165527,0.0018482208,-0.00044178963,0.061187744,0.010986328,0.018234253,0.019699097,-0.021255493,0.02293396,0.002855301,0.058502197,-0.020828247,-0.0032749176,-0.084106445,0.006134033,-0.03918457,-0.00034189224,0.006099701,0.023239136,-0.05255127,0.008270264,-0.013809204,-0.00067806244,-0.007286072,-0.019744873,0.04815674,0.044891357,0.048583984,-0.0044136047,0.038604736,0.028015137,-0.0030326843,-0.006919861,0.0049362183,-0.02116394,0.055511475,-0.016708374,0.09454346,-0.006465912,-0.05526733