51	54	0	A crise nos planos de saúde no Brasil está crescendo, com um aumento significativo nas ações judiciais contra operadoras, mesmo em um cenário de lucros elevados. Especialistas apontam que a insatisfação dos consumidores, devido a negativas de cobertura e demoras, tem levado a um aumento nas disputas judiciais. O setor registrou lucros operacionais de R$ 9,3 bilhões, mas enfrenta críticas sobre reajustes abusivos e a eficácia do sistema regulatório. Ação judicial, planos de saúde, judicialização, ações judiciais, lucros, cobertura, consumidores, SUS, regulação	[-0.0010881424,0.03253174,0.05999756,0.038726807,-0.0037879944,0.040863037,-0.021881104,-0.009681702,0.025375366,-0.024108887,0.03967285,-0.07128906,-0.047180176,0.004547119,0.024902344,-0.004299164,-0.013168335,-0.015365601,-0.022918701,-0.02961731,0.029190063,0.01197052,0.027160645,-0.026519775,0.0004210472,-0.02279663,-0.025924683,-0.03125,-0.009925842,0.006164551,0.049865723,-0.00022780895,-0.0015096664,-0.00242424,-0.047607422,0.044403076,-0.048309326,0.022247314,0.048950195,0.042236328,0.011482239,0.022659302,-0.040374756,0.01687622,-0.017532349,-0.017654419,0.018707275,-0.03363037,-0.018066406,0.04849243,-0.023391724,0.029327393,-0.02532959,-0.008522034,0.03942871,0.0070495605,-0.0099487305,0.06365967,0.0077552795,-0.033966064,0.048553467,0.0017232895,-0.051208496,-0.026275635,-0.022018433,0.017105103,0.022125244,0.014724731,-0.026168823,-0.010528564,0.0003170967,0.01626587,0.019470215,0.024551392,0.025604248,8.404255e-05,0.06640625,0.018325806,0.027282715,0.014701843,-0.018753052,0.012382507,0.016693115,0.049865723,-0.023635864,-0.003829956,-0.09814453,0.017349243,-0.025543213,0.013671875,0.010269165,0.017089844,-0.042022705,0.008613586,-0.00667572,0.0013332367,-0.02154541,0.013313293,0.03778076,0.05807495,0.053222656,-0.018310547,0.060668945,0.004142761,-0.008766174,0.011726379,0.011688232,-0.016235352,0.04095459,-0.011581421,0.0949707,0.026672363,-0.05303955,0.019973755,-0.003112793,-0.0055809