52	55	0	O artigo analisa a judicialização da saúde suplementar no Brasil, destacando seu crescimento e os desafios que representa para a sustentabilidade do setor. Apresenta dados sobre o aumento de processos judiciais, suas motivações e os impactos financeiros, além de discutir cenários futuros e recomendações para mitigar o problema. Ação judicial, judicialização, saúde suplementar, IESS, custos, processos judiciais, reformas, tratamentos, medicamentos, direitos, sustentabilidade Instituto de Estudos de Saúde Suplementar (IESS)	[0.0031280518,0.010498047,0.04421997,0.025100708,-0.025024414,0.055847168,0.015777588,-0.009185791,-0.0037288666,-0.0146484375,0.0491333,-0.068847656,-0.05001831,0.003271103,0.020355225,0.0074157715,-0.010398865,-0.023727417,-0.00844574,-0.0005335808,-0.0014562607,0.0146102905,0.043029785,0.01914978,0.006290436,-0.07409668,-0.0024776459,-0.011856079,-0.010421753,0.0043182373,0.076660156,-0.008979797,-0.017303467,-0.04071045,-0.039520264,0.08380127,-0.040802002,0.013931274,0.036895752,0.055114746,0.060699463,0.025131226,-0.027114868,0.03515625,-0.031311035,-0.050720215,0.03466797,-0.045684814,-0.021697998,0.013580322,-0.029937744,0.0541687,0.00019776821,-0.0019302368,0.06011963,-0.011528015,-0.027389526,0.062347412,-0.0065231323,-0.05429077,0.035980225,0.002729416,-0.030761719,-0.007896423,-0.06774902,0.030670166,0.0053367615,-0.019104004,0.0054893494,-0.031707764,-0.00038051605,0.007133484,0.0039901733,0.023895264,-0.013557434,0.021957397,0.03491211,0.00057172775,0.036865234,0.010681152,-0.05645752,0.048065186,-0.025848389,0.066711426,-0.010055542,0.009643555,-0.046569824,0.013916016,-0.07598877,0.003566742,-0.021453857,0.018249512,-0.04159546,-0.0084991455,0.025131226,0.008903503,-0.027709961,-0.0010614395,0.03982544,0.032836914,0.0062294006,-0.020858765,0.008041382,-0.025665283,0.01651001,0.0017633438,0.0007748604,-0.02128601,0.017501831,-0.053497314,0.05819702,0.02381897,-0.049713135,0.03970337,0.02319336,-0.036376953,0.0027561188,0.0067