53	56	0	O texto analisa a situação econômica e política dos EUA sob a administração de Donald Trump, destacando a crise do império americano, a guerra tarifária com a China, a crescente dependência de importações e a fragilidade fiscal do país. A estratégia de Trump para reindustrializar os EUA e manter a hegemonia do dólar enfrenta desafios significativos, incluindo a desdolarização e a competição com a China. O texto também menciona a militarização da política externa americana e os riscos de uma crise financeira. Trump, EUA, hegemonia, dólar, guerra tarifária, China, crise financeira, desdolarização, política externa	[0.000562191,0.052947998,0.030639648,0.032470703,0.040496826,0.045288086,-0.013175964,0.04309082,-0.0065231323,-0.004962921,0.025283813,0.019805908,-0.07745361,0.025283813,0.034484863,-0.0005469322,-0.059326172,0.0035419464,0.023239136,0.027999878,-0.0007429123,0.050201416,0.009300232,-0.005809784,-0.012817383,0.015899658,-0.0053901672,-0.03012085,-0.0501709,0.02885437,0.023834229,-0.00031375885,0.030929565,0.0051193237,-0.019729614,0.049346924,-0.052978516,0.010612488,0.05670166,-0.003068924,0.03363037,0.030075073,0.013442993,0.014007568,0.020095825,-0.010093689,-0.016464233,-0.0039978027,0.016174316,0.014144897,-0.03643799,0.023345947,0.018615723,0.037139893,-0.001282692,0.035980225,0.002521515,-0.010658264,0.0104599,-0.026428223,0.029632568,-0.017471313,-0.03640747,0.019348145,-0.030456543,0.042022705,-0.011672974,0.026428223,-0.027389526,-0.03125,0.015625,-0.026351929,-0.00031089783,-0.030731201,0.020904541,-0.04486084,-0.039520264,-0.042907715,-0.026412964,-0.008758545,-0.044433594,-0.008483887,-0.022216797,-0.019714355,0.0061531067,-0.0019397736,-0.011634827,0.04534912,-0.0041389465,-0.023666382,-0.03024292,-0.0008625984,-0.010513306,-0.061462402,-0.052703857,0.009857178,-0.045806885,0.024337769,0.011833191,0.01928711,0.0040130615,0.0055389404,-0.0005965233,0.03479004,-0.0016088486,0.0045166016,-0.0010499954,-0.023757935,-0.0033988953,0.0413818